# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client build configuration. Everything here is PUBLIC.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the shipped JavaScript bundle. Anyone who
# loads the site can read them. NEVER put an API key, token, or password in this
# file or in any .env file consumed by the client build.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional override for the assistant proxy URL. This is a non-secret location,
# not a credential.
#
# Leave UNSET to use the deployed default:
#     https://epsa-gemini-proxy.e-psa.workers.dev/
#
# Set to a different URL to point at another proxy, or to the empty string to
# ship with the live AI assistant disabled. When disabled, the patient handout
# and guideline-topic answers continue to work and the UI shows
# "AI assistant offline — handout & topics only".
#
# VITE_ASSISTANT_ENDPOINT=https://epsa-gemini-proxy.e-psa.workers.dev/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Gemini API key is NOT configured here and must never be. It lives only as
# a server-side secret on the proxy Worker.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
